description	"Melee Mando

^2Weaponry (x2 FP damage):
- Punch
- Ranged Punch
- Hot Punch (Plasmathrower) ^3[CS3]
- Hot Ranged Punch (Wrist Rockets)
- Really Hard Punch (Thermal Rocket) ^3[CS1]
- Wrist Laser ^3[CS2]

^5Powers:
- Jump (1)
- Magnetic Gloves (Pull 2)

^6Inventory:
- Portable Shield
- Cloak (2)
- Seeker Droid
- Portable E-Web
- Medpack & Advanced Medpack

^8Attributes:
- Taunting damages nearby enemies with force pool
- Melee Damage Resistance
- Force Sense Immunity
- Stamina (3)
- Dexterity (2)
- Cortosis (1) / Blast / Mag Plating Armour
- Strength (3)
- 1 Extra Life
- Rally & Assemble (1)

^3Abilities:
- Jetpack
- Flipkick (1)
- Dispense Force / Armor / Resource [Hold Use on Allies]
- Spy Disguise (2) [Weapon Mode In Melee]

Melee Mando was hit very hard on his head one day and decided, I will use my fists to right the wrongs of this world."